        <briefdescription>
<para>Initialize a new key list iterator. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Executes a function specified in the given functional index definition and initializes a new iterator over the MsgPack array with keys. Each key is a nested MsgPack array.</para><para>When validate flag is set, each array entry is validated to match the given functional index key definition. Uses fiber region to allocate memory.</para><para><parameterlist kind="retval"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>0</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>in case of success </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>-1</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>on function error, validation error, memory error. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
